# i-CAPE Frontend

## UI

- Use **shadcn/ui** (+ Radix) for all standard UI primitives
- Icons: **Lucide React only** — no hand-drawn SVG, no emoji icons, no mixed icon libraries
- No base64 images — use Cloudinary for media
- Consistent design tokens (spacing, typography, colors, radius, shadows)
- Look: premium, professional, institutional, enterprise — not childish or flashy

## Data & forms

- API calls only via `frontend/lib/api.ts` + `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`
- Server state: **TanStack Query**
- Forms: **React Hook Form + Zod**
- No hardcoded fake data in finished features (temp mocks must be isolated and removed)
- One table architecture for Admin (search/filter/sort/pagination where needed)
- Reuse EmptyState / LoadingState / ErrorState / ConfirmDialog patterns
- Toasts for feedback — never `alert()` / `window.confirm()` for main UI

## Next.js

- App Router; Server Components by default
- `"use client"` only when interactivity/state requires it
- Responsive via Tailwind; keep accessibility from shadcn/Radix
